    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I didn't plane to do it in this PR at first but make sense to do it now in fact. Actually, it looks like it's not possible to override method definition with another one that is not compatible with the existing one (or I didn't found how to do it). The two methods are incompatible because the callback accepts different arguments.\r\n\r\nIt means that we have to write our own version of the definition for the Helper. We can take the one shipped on DefinitelyTyped and update it. Once we release the next major of the Helper we can update the one on DefinitelyTyped.",
